# SPEC.md 3.1 THE LITMUS. Parent = Person AND EXISTS hasChild.Person,
# Mother subseteq Person AND EXISTS hasChild.Person.
# Expect: entails Mother subseteq Parent. Derivable ONLY through the existential
# on the defining side -- what materialization cannot see. If HOWL derives this it
# is a DL reasoner; if not it is a materialization engine.

@prefix :    <http://example.org/t#> .
@prefix owl:  <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdf:  <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix xsd:  <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

<http://example.org/t> a owl:Ontology .
:Person a owl:Class . :Parent a owl:Class . :Mother a owl:Class .
:hasChild a owl:ObjectProperty .

:Parent owl:equivalentClass
  [ a owl:Class ; owl:intersectionOf
    ( :Person [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty :hasChild ; owl:someValuesFrom :Person ] ) ] .

:Mother rdfs:subClassOf
  [ a owl:Class ; owl:intersectionOf
    ( :Person [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty :hasChild ; owl:someValuesFrom :Person ] ) ] .
